<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands placeholder>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "Peculiar Curiosities">>
You stumble upon a house filled with strange apparatus and scattered research notes.
Among the clutter, one relic stands out a device said to replicate items by using mana.
An old belt hangs from a nearby hook. It looks rather dull, but its construction is surprisingly sturdy.
-> Use the relic device #paneldetails=Duplicate_1_card_from_your_deck.
    You carefully place the relic into the device and follow the instructions written in the research notes.
    The apparatus hums as mana gathers around it, and a duplicate of one of your cards takes shape.
    <<duplicate_card YarnCommands>>
